<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Petrobras started as accumulate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Petrobras started as accumulate.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. said it initiated coverage of state-owned Petroleo Brasileiro (Petrobras) with an accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- It said earnings should rise dramatically if expected reforms of Brazil's oil market are achieved.</p>
<p>-- It said the company's current market valuation does not reflect its earnings and cash-flow potential in a free market, nor fully reflect its positive outlook under current regulatory limits.</p>
</text>
